      "Language": "fre",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Hematocolpos with homolateral renal agenesis is a rare condition. Dysmenorrhea and paroxysmal abdominal pain are common symptoms in adolescent girls. Following a review of the literature, this article considers those procedures and investigations which can be used to help these patients before arriving at the stage of reconstructive surgery."},
